    "titleSanskrit": "Divyavadana",
    "titleZh": "梵文贝叶佛典《Divyavadana》总持真言选 (divyav_u.htm)",
    "totalLines": 16482,
    "mantraVerses": [
      "durnyasto bhidyate mantraḥ prītirbhidyate lobhataḥ//2// iti//",
      "tato gośīrṣacandanavane pañcamātrāṇi kuṭhāraśatāni voḍhumārabdhāni/",
      "tairekasvareṇa sarvairevaṃ nādo muktah--namastasmai āryāya pūrṇāya, namo namastasmai āryāya pūrṇāyeti/",
      "bhūtapūrvaṃ bhikṣavo 'sminneva bhadrakalpe viṃśativarṣasahasrāyuṣi prajāyāṃ kāśyapo nāma samyaksambuddho loka udapādi vidyācaraṇasampannaḥ sugato lokavidanuttaraḥ puruṣadamyasārathiḥ śāstā devānāṃ manuṣyāṇāṃ ca/",
      "vācāvasāne bhagavato muṇḍāḥ saṃvṛttastraidhātukavītarāgāḥ samaloṣṭakānñcanā ākāśapāṇitalasamacittā vāsīcandanakalpā vidyāvidāritāṇḍakośā vidyābhijñnāpratisaṃvitprāptā bhavalābhalobhasatkāraparānmukhāḥ/",
      "tatra tena puruṣeṇa tasmādeva samudrakūlānmahāmakarināmauṣadhīṃ samanviṣya gṛhya netre anñjayitvā śirasi baddhvā samālabhya mahānataṃ plavamāsthāya suptaṃ tārākṣaṃ dakarākṣasaṃ viditvā pūrvabuddhabhāṣitāmeraṇḍāṃ nāma mahāvidyāmuccārayatā mantrapadāṃ dakarākṣasasamīpena gantavyam",
      "na śakyate 'bhiroḍhum/",
      "jāmbudvīpakāni ratnāni, tadyathāmaṇayo muktā vaidūryaśaṅkhaśilāpravālarajatajātarūpamaśmagarbho musāragalvo lohitikā dakṣiṇāvartāh etāni ca/"
    ],
