      "BrhUpBh BrhUpBh BrhUpBh BrhUpBh,3.21 idānīṃ yo 'sau sarvātmabhāvo mokṣo vidyāphalaṃ kriyākārakaphalaśūnyaṃ sa pratyakṣato nirdiśyate yatrāvidyākāmakarmāṇi na santi",
