    "titleZh": "毗湿奴般遮罗怛罗密续 (Vaiṣṇava-Pañcarātra)《Srinivasamakhi Vedantadesika: Dasavidhahetunirupana》真言曼怛罗选 (sdahen_u.htm)",
    "deityZh": "那罗延毗湿奴 · 吉祥天女 · 奎师那 (Nārāyaṇa-Lakṣmī)",
    "traditionLabelZh": "毗湿奴般遮罗怛罗密续 (Vaiṣṇava-Pañcarātra)",
    "subcorpusPath": "1_sanskr/4_rellit/vaisn/sdahen_u.htm",
    "totalLines": 3620,
    "mantraVerses": [
      "BrahmāṇḍaP: Brahmāṇḍapurāṇa of Kṛṣṇa Dvaipāyana Vyāsa.",
      "vikhanā nāma kaścid ṛṣiḥ, uta nārāyaṇaḥ? nārāyaṇa eva kevalaṃ.",
      "\"yadi vidyāc caturvedān sāṅgopaniṣadān dvijaḥ",
      "\"namas te devadeveśa\" ity ārabhya stotramadhye \"phenapācārya vālakhilya vikhano vikhanasa vaikhānasācārya abhagnayoga abhagnaparisaṅkhyāna\" iti.",
      "sametyānyonyasaṃyogaṃ parasparasamāśrayāḥ",
      "prākṛtaṃ brahmarūpasya viṣṇoḥ sthānam anuttamam",
      "mahopaniṣadi: \"athāto mahopaniṣadaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ. eko ha vai nārāyaṇa āsīd\" ity ārabhya \"tasya dhyānāntassthasya yajñastomam ucyate. tasmin caturdaśapuruṣā jāyante. ekā kanyā. daśendriyāṇi mana ekādaśaṃ tejo dvādaśam ahaṅkāraḥ trayodaśaḥ praṇāś caturdaśaḥ ātmā pañcadaśaḥ buddhir bhūtāni pañca tanmātrāṇi pañca mahābhūtāni ca sa ekaḥ pañcaviṃśaḥ puruṣaḥ.\" \"atha punar eva nārāyaṇas so 'nyatkāmo manasā dhyāyata tasya dhyānāntassthasya lalāṭāt svedo 'patat, ta imāḥ pratatā āpaḥ, tāsu tejaḥ, tat tejo hiraṇmayam aṇḍam tatra brahmā caturmukho 'jāyata.\" iti.",
      "pṛṣṭhato 'nuyayau viṣṇuṃ vastreṇocchādya cānanam",
      "\"om ity ekākṣaraṃ brahma vyāharan saṃsmaran harim",
      "āyāsāyāparaṃ karma vidyānyā śilpanaipuṇam",
      "taṃ prāha bhagavān viṣṇuḥ praṇataṃ purataḥ sthitam",
      "vasiṣṭha: \"api cedaṃ purā rāma śrutaṃ me brahmadarśanam",
      "aiśvarye vāruṇe rāma rudrasyeśasya vai prabhoḥ",
      "tathā vedās sopaniṣado vidyās sāvitry athāpi ca",
      "\"pauruhan mahaṃ bhavati. puruhānnādo vā etena vaikhānaso 'ñjasā svargaṃ lokam apaśyat\" iti. atra indraśabdena paramātmā nārāyaṇa ucyate. \"sa brahmā sa śivassendrasso 'kṣaraḥ paramas svarāṭ\" ityādi śrutibhyaḥ.",
      "yājayed yajñapuruṣaṃ viṣṇuṃ rājā jagaddhitaḥ",
      "\" iti",
      "viṣṇuñ ca puruṣaṃ satyam acyutañ ca yudhiṣṭhira",
      "pañcamūrtividhānena madhye viṣṇuṃ samarcayet",
      "tadvāstvaṅgālaye viṣṇuṃ tāntrikeṇa na cārcayet",
      "pañcamūrtikrameṇaiva viṣṇuṃ saṃsthāpya pūjayet",
      "pṛṣṭhato 'nuyayau viṣṇuṃ vastreṇācchādya cānanam",
      "trimūrtīnāṃ yathā viṣṇuś śivānān tu sadāśivaḥ",
      "yato hi karmabhūr eṣā hy ato 'nyā bhogabhūmayaḥ",
      "puruṣair yajñapuruṣo jambūdvīpe sadejyate",
      "kintu teṣāṃ sūtrāntareṣv anuktānāṃ vānaprasthāśramasvīkāraprayogaśrāmaṇakāgnikuṇḍavidhānādīnāṃ vikhanas sūtre pratipāditānāṃ tatsūtroktaprakāreṇa vānaprasthāśramasvīkārādinaiva vaikhānasatvasiddhir iti.",
      "\"vānaprastho vaikhānasaśāstrasamudācāro vane mūlaphalāśī tapaśśīlas savaneṣūdakam upaspṛśan śrāmaṇakenāgnim ādhāyāgrāmyabhojī devapitṛmanuṣyabhūtarṣipūjakaḥ sarvātithiḥ pratiṣiddhavarjaṃ bhaikṣam apy upayuñjīta. na phālakṛṣṭam adhitiṣṭhet grāmaṃ vā na praviśet\" iti.",
      "hārīta: \"vānaprastho grāmyā oṣadhīḥ parivarjayet. tretāgnīnāṃ sthāne śrāmaṇakaṃ vāgnim ādhāya valkalaśāṇacarmakuśamuñjādivalkalaṃ vā vasāno vaikhānasaproktena vidhinā vānaprastho bhavati. anujñāyiko 'nuprasthāyika\" iti.",
      "yama: \"śrāmaṇakena vidhānena sāyaṃ prātar upaspṛśed\" iti.",
      "śaṅkhalikhitau: \"śrāmaṇakenāgnim ādhāya kāle kuruvindaveṇuśyāmākanīvārādibhir vartayed\" iti.",
      "vasiṣṭho 'pi: \"śrāmaṇakenāgnim ādhāyāhitāgnir vṛkṣamūlika\" iti.",
      "\"śrāmaṇakaṃ nāma vaikhānasaśāstram. taduktena vidhināgnim ādhāya\" iti.",
      "vanasthānān tu sarveṣāṃ vidhiśrāmaṇakābhidhaḥ",
      "hārītasmṛtau: \"pūrvaṃ vikhanaso viṣṇuḥ proktavān svayam acyutaḥ",
      "marīcir mandare viṣṇuṃ arcayamāsa keśavam",
      "ādeśād brahmaṇo viṣṇuṃ śrīnivāse 'trir arcayet",
      "nanāma ca tadā viṣṇuṃ śaṅkhacakragadādharam",
      "vanasthānān tu sarveṣāṃ vidhiś śrāmaṇakābhidhaḥ",
      "vaikhānasasya sūtrasya cāgneḥ śrāmaṇakasya ca",
      "agnīṣomādayo devā ye yajñāṃśahavir bhujaḥ",
      "viṣṇuñ ca puruṣaṃ satyam acyutañ cāniruddhakam",
      "nārāyaṇaḥ svayaṃ garbhe mudrāṃ dhārayate nijām",
      "brahmāpi bhagavān devo harir nārāyaṇaḥ smṛtaḥ",
      "arcakaṃ toṣayed viṣṇuṃ yas toṣayitum icchati",
      "pravakti bhagavān viṣṇuḥ sukhaduḥkhadvayaṃ nṛṇām",
      "na śakyā vistarād vaktuṃ saṅkṣepeṇa śṛṇuṣva tam",
      "dvāpare dvāpare viṣṇur vyāsarūpī mahāmune",
      "vedam ekaṃ subahudhā karoti jagatāṃ hitaḥ",
      "hitāya sarvabhūtānāṃ vedabhedaṃ karoti saḥ",
      "cāturhotram abhūd yasmiṃs tena yajñam athākarot",
      "audgātraṃ sāmabhiś cakre brahmatvañ cāpy atharvabhiḥ",
      "yajurbhiś ca yajurvedaṃ sāmavedañ ca sāmābhiḥ",
      "trimūrtīnāṃ yathā viṣṇuḥ śivānān tu sadāśivaḥ",
      "yo vai vighneśa ity uktas sa vai nārāyaṇaḥ smṛtaḥ",
      "ityādi pauṣkarasaṃhitāvacanānusāreṇa svātantryeṇa durgādidevatāntarārcanapratipādakapāñcarātraśāstraniṣṭhānāṃ vyāvṛttiḥ. \"nūnam atra mato deva\" ity anena - \"yatra vaikhānasā viprā yatra santi gavāṃ gaṇāḥ",
      "brāhme muhūrte buddhyeta dhyāyan nārāyaṇaṃ param",
      "iti sandhyopāsanādīnāṃ bhagavadārādhanarūpatvoktyā teṣāñ ca tyāgas sambhavati. atas sāmānyataḥ iti vaktum ayuktam. śrutismṛtipurāṇādiṣu mukhyādhikāritvena pratipāditā devalakāḥ iti cet - tad asat. \"'agnir vai devānām avamo viṣṇuḥ paramas tadantareṇa sarvā anyā devatā'; iti brāhmaṇam. tasmād gṛhe paramaṃ viṣṇuṃ pratiṣṭhāpya sāyaṃ prātar homānte 'rcayati\" iti vaikhānasasūtre, \"pravaḥ pāntam andhaso dhiyāyate maheśūrāya viṣṇave cārcata\" iti ṛgbrāhmaṇam anusṛtya viṣṇupradhānatayā \"sa vā eṣa puruṣaḥ pañcadhā pañcātmā\" ityādiśrutyuktaviṣṇvādipañcamūrtīnām ārādhanasya pratipāditatvāt.",
      "\"pratigraheṇa tejo hi viprāṇāṃ śāmyate\" ity ānuśāsanikavacanāc ca pratigraheṇa brahmatejonāśanaṃ smaryate. śrūyate pratigrahe prāyaścittam api. \"yo yājayati prati vā gṛhṇāti yājayitvā pratigṛhya vānaśnaṃs tris svādhyāyam adhīyīta trirātraṃ sāvitrīṃ gāyatrīm anvatirecayati varo dakṣiṇā vareṇaiva varaṃ spṛṇoty ātmā hi varaḥ\" iti.",
      "katham abhyarcito viṣṇuḥ na dahet sarvakilbiṣam",
      "śivaśekharatantre - rudraḥ:"
    ],
